"switch closed-display mode with the session" = "隨工作階段切換闔蓋模式";
"pause AWDL (turn off the Wi-Fi AirDrop/Handoff radio hops)" = "暫停 AWDL（關閉 Wi-Fi 的 AirDrop/Handoff 無線跳頻）";
"macOS is asking for your administrator password to %@. The dialog may be titled “osascript”: that's Keepresso running the command, and nothing else is changed. To stop these prompts for good, install the administrator helper (Preferences ▸ General)." = "macOS 正在要求您輸入系統管理員密碼，以便%@。對話方塊標題可能顯示為「osascript」：這是 Keepresso 在執行指令，不會變更其他任何項目。若要徹底停止這類要求，請安裝系統管理員輔助程式（偏好設定 ▸ 一般）。";
"Keepresso keeps your Mac awake on your terms. It lives in the menu bar near the clock, with no Dock icon. Click its cup any time to start or stop." = "Keepresso 依您的規則讓 Mac 保持喚醒，位於選單列時鐘旁，沒有 Dock 圖示。隨時點按它的咖啡杯即可開始或停止。";
"Pick one to set up matching triggers, or keep it manual and add your own later. You can change this any time in Preferences." = "選擇其中一項即可設定對應的觸發條件，或維持手動並之後再自行新增。您可隨時在偏好設定中變更此設定。";
"Activation is controlled by triggers.\nEdit them in Preferences." = "啟用狀態由觸發條件控制。\n請在偏好設定中編輯。";
"Why each session started or stopped, newest first. Kept in memory; clears on relaunch." = "說明每個工作階段開始或停止的原因，最新的在最前面。僅保存在記憶體中，重新啟動後即清除。";
"Every app's live power assertions, not just Keepresso's, the same data pmset -g assertions prints." = "所有 App 目前的電源聲明，不只是 Keepresso 的，與 pmset -g assertions 顯示的資料相同。";
"Lets the Mac sleep once battery charge drops below this level, even mid-session, so it doesn't run flat." = "當電量降至此程度以下時，即使工作階段正在進行也讓 Mac 進入睡眠，以免電力完全耗盡。";
"Shows the remaining time next to the menu-bar icon during a timed session." = "在定時工作階段期間，於選單列圖示旁顯示剩餘時間。";
"Reopen the first-run welcome, with quick one-click setup for how you use your Mac." = "重新開啟首次執行時的歡迎畫面，並依您使用 Mac 的方式提供一鍵快速設定。";
"If that time already passed today, it means tomorrow." = "若該時間今天已經過去，則代表明天。";
"Runs past midnight into the next day." = "會跨越午夜延續到隔天。";
"Keeps the Mac awake while a partial-download file (.crdownload, .download, .part, and the like) exists in the chosen folder, then lets it sleep once the download finishes. Holds for 30 seconds between files in a batch." = "只要所選資料夾中存在未完成的下載檔案（如 .crdownload、.download、.part 等），就讓 Mac 保持喚醒；下載完成後即可讓 Mac 進入睡眠。同一批次的檔案之間會保持 30 秒。";
"Stays awake on battery too; the display turns off when the lid closes. Turn it off before putting it in a bag." = "使用電池時也會保持喚醒；闔蓋後螢幕本身仍會關閉。放入背包前請先關閉此功能。";
"The calendar rule needs Calendar access (System Settings ▸ Privacy)" = "行事曆規則需要行事曆存取權（系統設定 ▸ 隱私權與安全性）";
"Wi-Fi rules need Location access (System Settings ▸ Privacy)" = "Wi-Fi 規則需要定位服務存取權（系統設定 ▸ 隱私權與安全性）";
"Checks an always-on Mac (e.g. a headless Mac mini) needs. Keepresso can read these but can't change the system ones, so use the links and commands below." = "常保開機的 Mac（例如無螢幕的 Mac mini）所需的檢查項目。Keepresso 可讀取這些設定，但無法變更系統設定，請使用下方的連結與指令。";
"macOS hops the Wi-Fi radio off-channel for AWDL about once a second, which shows up as ping spikes mid-game or mid-stream. Diagnose it here, and pause AWDL for the session if it's the culprit." = "macOS 大約每秒會將 Wi-Fi 無線電切換到其他頻道以供 AWDL 使用，這會在遊戲或串流過程中造成 ping 值突增。您可以在此進行診斷，若確認是 AWDL 造成的，可在此工作階段中暫停 AWDL。";
"Pings 1.1.1.1 five times a second for 10 seconds and checks whether latency spikes on AWDL's once-a-second cadence." = "以每秒 5 次的頻率對 1.1.1.1 執行 ping，共 10 秒，並檢查延遲是否以 AWDL 每秒一次的節奏出現突增。";
"Counts only while a game (or a cloud-gaming app) is the active window, not just running in the background. Keeps holding for 5 minutes after you switch away." = "僅在遊戲（或雲端遊戲 App）為使用中視窗時才會計入，而非只是在背景執行。切換到其他 App 後仍會維持 5 分鐘。";
"How long the pause lingers after the game stops being the active window, so a quick alt-tab doesn't flap the radios. Shorter brings AirDrop and Handoff back faster; longer rides out launchers and loading screens." = "遊戲不再是使用中視窗後，暫停狀態會維持多久，避免快速切換視窗時無線電頻繁開關。時間較短可讓 AirDrop 與 Handoff 較快恢復；時間較長則可撐過啟動器與讀取畫面。";
"Posts a notification when a game is detected and AWDL pauses, and again when it resumes. A notice that your administrator password is needed is always sent (even behind a fullscreen game), regardless of this switch." = "偵測到遊戲並暫停 AWDL 時會發出通知，恢復時也會再次發出通知。無論此開關是否開啟，都一定會傳送需要輸入系統管理員密碼的提示（即使在全螢幕遊戲之下也一樣）。";
"One step left, in System Settings: under General ▸ Login Items & Extensions (“Login Items” on older macOS), find Keepresso in the “Allow in the Background” list and turn its switch ON. macOS asks for your administrator password once; this updates by itself when you're done." = "還差一步，請前往系統設定：在「一般 ▸ 登入項目與延伸功能」（較舊版 macOS 為「登入項目」）中，於「允許在背景執行」清單找到 Keepresso 並開啟其開關。macOS 會要求輸入一次系統管理員密碼；完成後此畫面會自動更新。";
"Turns the pause on right now and keeps it on until you turn it off or quit Keepresso (it isn't tied to whether a keep-awake session is brewing). While it's on, AirDrop, Handoff, Sidecar, and Continuity Camera take a break, and the once-a-second lag spikes stop. Everything comes back the moment you turn it off or quit Keepresso; even if the app crashes, macOS is restored automatically. With the administrator helper installed the switch is always instant and silent; without it, macOS asks for your password once per launch (the system dialog may show “osascript”, which is Keepresso running the command)." = "立即開啟暫停功能，並持續開啟直到您將其關閉或結束 Keepresso 為止（與保持喚醒工作階段是否進行中無關）。開啟期間，AirDrop、Handoff、Sidecar 與接續互通相機會暫停運作，每秒一次的延遲突增也會隨之停止。只要您關閉此功能或結束 Keepresso，一切都會立即恢復；即使 App 當機，macOS 也會自動還原設定。已安裝系統管理員輔助程式時，此開關一律即時且無需輸入密碼；未安裝時，macOS 會在每次啟動時要求輸入一次密碼（系統對話方塊可能顯示「osascript」，這是 Keepresso 在執行指令）。";
"Watches for a game (or a cloud-gaming app like GeForce NOW) as the active window and pauses AWDL on its own, then lifts the pause a little after you switch away (the delay below). It only counts while the game is in front and in use, not just running in the background. Without the administrator helper, turning this on asks for your password once per app run, right now rather than mid-game; with the helper it never asks at all. No trigger setup needed: leave this on and forget it." = "監看遊戲（或如 GeForce NOW 等雲端遊戲 App）是否為使用中視窗，並自動暫停 AWDL，之後在您切換離開一段時間後（見下方延遲設定）解除暫停。僅在遊戲位於最前且使用中時才會計入，而非只是在背景執行。若未安裝系統管理員輔助程式，開啟此功能會在每次執行 App 時要求輸入一次密碼，是在現在而非遊戲進行中要求；安裝輔助程式後則完全不會詢問。不需另外設定觸發條件，開啟後即可不再理會。";
"Pause AWDL to steady your connection, and test your jitter, in Gaming & Streaming." = "請前往「遊戲與串流」暫停 AWDL 以穩定連線，並測試您的抖動狀況。";
"Two independent switches. Preventing system sleep keeps the Mac itself running: work finishes, downloads complete, and it stays reachable over the network, while the screen is still free to turn off. Preventing display sleep also keeps the screen lit, which is what you want for a dashboard or a video, and what drains a battery fastest. Most setups want system sleep prevented and display sleep left alone." = "兩個各自獨立的開關。防止系統睡眠可讓 Mac 本身持續運作：工作得以完成、下載得以完成，並持續可透過網路連線，同時螢幕仍可自由關閉。防止螢幕睡眠則會讓螢幕保持亮著，適合儀表板或影片這類情境，也是最耗電的做法。大多數情況下應防止系統睡眠，並讓螢幕睡眠維持原狀。";
"“Launch at login” starts Keepresso itself when you log in, so the cup is always in the menu bar. “Start keep-awake on launch” goes further and begins a session right away, using the default duration, for an always-on Mac that shouldn't need a rule to stay up. It's ignored while triggers are controlling activation, since your conditions decide then." = "「登入時啟動」會在您登入時啟動 Keepresso 本身，讓咖啡杯始終留在選單列中。「啟動時開始保持喚醒」則更進一步，會立即以預設時長開始一個工作階段，適合那種不需要靠規則來保持運作的常開 Mac。當觸發條件正在控制啟用狀態時，此設定會被忽略，因為此時由您的條件決定。";
"Starts a session as soon as Keepresso launches." = "Keepresso 啟動後立即開始一個工作階段。";
"System-wide, so it starts or stops keep-awake whatever app you're in. It needs at least one modifier key (Command, Option, Control, or Shift) so it can't fire while you're typing. Recording it asks for no Accessibility or Input Monitoring permission." = "全域生效，因此無論您在哪個 App 中，都能開始或停止保持喚醒。它至少需要一個修飾鍵（Command、Option、Control 或 Shift 鍵），這樣才不會在您打字時誤觸發。錄製此按鍵不會要求輔助使用或輸入監視權限。";
"Starts or stops keep-awake from any app." = "可從任何 App 開始或停止保持喚醒。";
"Fifteen languages are available. Changing this relaunches Keepresso, so the menu, every window, and notifications all switch together instead of drifting apart. Set it back to “Follow System” to follow your Mac's language again." = "共有十五種語言可選。變更此設定會重新啟動 Keepresso，讓選單、每個視窗與通知一併切換，而不會各自為政。改回「跟隨系統」即可再次跟隨 Mac 的語言。";
"Keepresso follows your system language by default." = "Keepresso 預設會跟隨系統語言。";
"Handles the privileged switches for Keepresso, with no password prompts." = "為 Keepresso 處理具特殊權限的開關，無需輸入密碼。";
"Keeping the Mac awake stops it sleeping, but it doesn't reset app-level or enterprise idle detection: remote-desktop and VDI sessions, meeting presence (Teams, Slack), and corporate idle-logout can still mark you away or log you out. This tells macOS you're active as well, which those do notice. It only steps in once you've been idle a few seconds, so it never nudges the pointer while you're using the Mac or gaming. Off by default, and some managed Macs flag simulated activity, so check your policy first." = "讓 Mac 保持喚醒能防止其進入睡眠，但不會重置 App 層級或企業層級的閒置偵測：遠端桌面與 VDI 工作階段、會議在線狀態（Teams、Slack）以及企業閒置登出機制，仍可能將您標記為離開或將您登出。此功能也會告知 macOS 您處於使用中狀態，而這些系統確實會察覺這一點。此功能只會在您閒置數秒後才介入，因此在您使用 Mac 或遊戲時絕不會移動游標。預設為關閉，且部分受管理的 Mac 可能會偵測到模擬活動，請先確認貴機構的政策。";
"Also tells macOS you're active, so you aren't marked away." = "也會告知 macOS 您處於使用中狀態，因此不會被標記為離開。";
"While a session runs, the menu shows these as one-click “Stop in” buttons. Clicking one converts the running session to end that much later, so the Mac goes back to sleeping on its own without you remembering to switch it off. It continues the session rather than restarting it, and clicking another button simply replaces the countdown. Up to four, and the list stays sorted." = "工作階段執行期間，選單會將這些顯示為一鍵「多久後停止」按鈕。點按其中一個會將執行中的工作階段改為在那之後結束，讓 Mac 無需您記得手動關閉即可自行恢復睡眠。它會延續目前的工作階段而非重新開始，點按另一個按鈕則只會取代倒數計時。最多四個，清單始終保持排序。";
"One-click “Stop in” buttons shown in the menu while a session runs." = "工作階段執行時選單中顯示的一鍵「多久後停止」按鈕。";
"A safety net for a session you forget about. If the charge falls this low, Keepresso pauses the session and lets the Mac sleep, even mid-session, and tells you why in a notification. The menu-bar cup shows the pause as a last sip of low-power yellow. Plugging in resumes it on its own. This is the same slider as the one in the menu, so the two always agree." = "為容易被遺忘的工作階段提供一道安全防護。若電量降至此水準以下，Keepresso 會暫停工作階段並讓 Mac 進入睡眠（即使正處於工作階段中），並透過通知告知原因。選單列的咖啡杯會將此暫停顯示為代表低電量的黃色「最後一口」。插上電源後會自動恢復。這與選單中的滑桿為同一個，因此兩者的數值始終一致。";
"Lets the Mac sleep once charge drops below this level." = "當電量降至此水準以下時，讓 Mac 進入睡眠。";
"Writes everything you've configured (settings, trigger rules, and presets) to a JSON file, to keep as a backup or to carry to another Mac. The file is version-stamped and checked on import, so a file from a newer Keepresso is refused rather than half-read. Importing replaces your current configuration and ends any running session." = "將您設定的一切（設定、觸發規則與預設集）寫入 JSON 檔案，可用於備份或轉移到另一台 Mac。此檔案帶有版本標記，並會在匯入時進行檢查，因此來自較新版 Keepresso 的檔案會被拒絕，而非只讀取一部分。匯入將取代您目前的設定，並結束任何進行中的工作階段。";
"Save your settings, triggers, and presets to a JSON file." = "將您的設定、觸發條件與預設集儲存為 JSON 檔案。";
"Normally a MacBook sleeps the moment you shut the lid unless a display is attached. This keeps it running with the lid shut and nothing plugged in, on power or battery. The screen itself still turns off when the lid closes (unless an external display is attached), so it isn't lighting up uselessly inside the closed lid. It works by flipping a system setting (pmset disablesleep), so it stays in effect until you turn it off: closed and on battery, the Mac can still drain over time, so don't leave it on in a bag. “Only while brewing” ties it to the session instead, on when a keep-awake session starts, off when it ends or Keepresso quits (even after a crash). Both need administrator rights: silent with the administrator helper installed (see the top of this tab), otherwise macOS asks for your password, once per app run for “Only while brewing”." = "一般而言，只要未連接螢幕，MacBook 在闔蓋的瞬間就會進入睡眠。此選項可讓它在闔蓋且未連接任何裝置時繼續運作，無論使用電源或電池皆然。闔蓋時螢幕本身仍會關閉（除非已連接外接螢幕），因此不會在闔起的蓋子裡白白亮著。其運作方式是切換一項系統設定（pmset disablesleep），因此在您將其關閉前都會持續生效：闔蓋且使用電池時，Mac 仍可能隨時間耗盡電量，請勿讓其在背包中保持開啟。「僅在保持喚醒工作階段期間」則改為將其與工作階段綁定：於保持喚醒工作階段開始時開啟，於工作階段結束或 Keepresso 結束時關閉（即使是當機之後）。兩者皆需要系統管理員權限：已安裝系統管理員輔助程式時會靜默執行（請參閱此分頁頂端），否則 macOS 會要求輸入密碼，「僅在保持喚醒工作階段期間」為每次執行 App 時要求一次。";
"Keeps running with the lid shut and no external display." = "即使闔蓋且沒有外接螢幕，也能繼續運作。";
"A trigger is a condition Keepresso watches, checked once a second. With triggers on, they take over: Keepresso starts brewing the moment your conditions are met and stops when they aren't, so you never leave the Mac awake by accident. The manual switch in the menu steps aside while they're active. “Pause Triggers” in the menu bar stops them temporarily without touching your rules." = "觸發條件是 Keepresso 持續監看的一種狀態，每秒檢查一次。觸發條件開啟後會接管控制：一旦符合條件，Keepresso 便立即開始運作，條件不再符合時便停止，這樣您就不會不小心讓 Mac 持續保持喚醒。選單中的手動開關在觸發條件生效期間會讓位。選單列中的「暫停觸發條件」可在不更動規則的情況下暫時停用它們。";
"The listed conditions control the session instead of the manual switch." = "列出的條件將取代手動開關來控制工作階段。";
"A preset is a named bundle of trigger rules you apply in one click. The built-ins cover common setups (AI Agent, Meetings, Cloud Gaming, Remote Control, and more), and applying one replaces your current rules. Save your own rules under a name to reuse them or move between setups. Renaming a built-in makes it yours, and Keepresso stops updating it. “Restore default presets” brings back any built-in you removed." = "預設集是一組以名稱儲存的觸發規則包，可一鍵套用。內建預設集涵蓋常見情境（AI 代理、會議、雲端遊戲、遠端控制等），套用其中一個會取代目前的規則。將您自己的規則儲存為某個名稱，即可重複使用或在不同情境間切換。重新命名內建預設集會使其成為您自己的預設集，Keepresso 將不再更新它。「還原預設集」可找回任何已移除的內建預設集。";
"“any” keeps the Mac awake while at least one condition holds, so the rules pile up: add three and any of them is enough. “all” needs every one true at once, which narrows things down (on AC power and an external display connected means only while docked). Conditions are checked once a second, and Keepresso stops brewing as soon as they stop being met." = "「任一」會在至少一項條件成立時讓 Mac 保持喚醒，因此規則會不斷疊加：新增三項規則，只要其中任一項成立即可。「全部」則要求所有條件同時成立，可縮小範圍（使用電源時且已連接外接螢幕，代表僅限接上外接座時）。系統每秒檢查一次條件，條件不再成立後 Keepresso 便會立即停止運作。";
"Conditions Keepresso reads straight from the hardware, with no permission needed: whether you're on AC power, on battery, or charging, and whether an external display is connected. Good for a Mac that should only stay awake while it's docked or plugged in, especially combined with “all” to mean exactly that." = "此類條件由 Keepresso 直接從硬體讀取，無需任何權限：是否使用電源、使用電池，或正在充電，以及是否已連接外接螢幕。適合僅應在接上外接座或插電時才保持喚醒的 Mac，尤其是搭配「全部」使用時，恰好能表達這個意思。";
"Conditions about what the Mac is connected to or busy with: a chosen Wi-Fi network, a VPN, a Bluetooth device such as headphones or a controller, a mounted volume, or sustained network throughput for a large download, upload, or sync. Reading Wi-Fi names needs Location permission and Bluetooth needs its own, both requested from this menu; the rest ask for nothing." = "關於 Mac 目前連線對象或忙於處理什麼的條件：選定的 Wi-Fi 網路、VPN、藍牙裝置（如耳機或控制器）、已裝載的磁碟區，或用於大型下載、上傳或同步的持續網路流量。讀取 Wi-Fi 名稱需要定位權限，藍牙則需要自己的權限，兩者皆會從此選單請求；其餘條件不需要任何權限。";
"Conditions about what you're actually doing: an app running or frontmost, the camera or microphone in use, audio playing, a game in front, an AI agent working, a process by name, a download finishing in a folder you watch, CPU load above a threshold, a time window, or a calendar event in progress. The camera and microphone conditions read only the device's in-use signal (the green dot), never the stream, so neither asks for permission." = "關於您實際在做什麼的條件：某個 App 正在執行或位於最前、相機或麥克風使用中、正在播放音訊、某個遊戲位於最前、AI 代理正在工作、依名稱比對的處理程序、您監看的資料夾中有下載完成、CPU 負載超過閾值、某個時段，或某個行事曆事件正在進行。相機與麥克風條件僅會讀取裝置的使用中訊號（綠點），絕不讀取實際串流，因此兩者皆不會要求權限。";
"A nudge while a session is running, so a Mac left awake doesn't stay awake all night unnoticed. Left off, a one-time reminder tells you once, after the session has run this long. “Repeat” tells you again at every interval until you stop the session. This never stops anything itself, it only reminds you, and the sound is optional. If you'd rather the session end on its own, use a timed session or a quick-stop button instead." = "在工作階段執行期間提醒您一下，避免因遺忘而讓 Mac 整晚保持喚醒。若關閉，單次提醒只會在工作階段執行達到此時長後提醒您一次。「重複」會在每個間隔再次提醒您，直到您停止工作階段。此功能本身絕不會停止任何東西，只會提醒您，且提示音為選用項目。如果您希望工作階段自行結束，可改用計時工作階段或快速停止按鈕。";
"These cover the times a session ends without you: a timer expiring, trigger conditions dropping, or a low-battery pause. Stopping it yourself stays silent, since you already know. The warning is a heads-up a few minutes before a timed session runs out, so you can extend it before the Mac drops off. The action runs when the session ends: sleep the display or start the screen saver, handy for a Mac you walk away from. It's off by default so a timed session never surprises you." = "這涵蓋了工作階段在您不知情時結束的情況：計時器到期、觸發條件不再成立，或低電量暫停。您自行停止時不會提醒，因為您已經知道了。此提醒會在計時工作階段結束前幾分鐘提前告知您，讓您能在 Mac 斷線前延長工作階段。此動作會在工作階段結束時執行：讓螢幕進入睡眠或啟動螢幕保護程式，適合您會暫時離開的 Mac。此功能預設為關閉，讓計時工作階段不會讓您措手不及。";
"Fires when a session ends on its own, not when you stop it yourself." = "會在工作階段自行結束時觸發，而非您自行停止時。";
"A Mac with no monitor attached falls back to a fuzzy 1920 × 1080, which is what makes Screen Sharing and VNC look soft. This creates a higher-resolution HiDPI display in software, so the remote picture is crisp without plugging anything in. It uses a private macOS API, so treat it as experimental and expect it may break on a macOS update. A hardware HDMI or DisplayPort dummy plug does the same job with no software at all." = "未連接螢幕的 Mac 會回退到模糊的 1920 × 1080 解析度，這正是螢幕共享與 VNC 顯得模糊的原因。此功能會以軟體方式建立解析度更高的 HiDPI 虛擬螢幕，因此無需連接任何裝置即可獲得清晰的遠端畫面。此功能使用 macOS 私有 API，請視為實驗性功能，且 macOS 更新後可能失效。硬體 HDMI 或 DisplayPort 假負載接頭能達到相同效果，且完全不需要軟體。";
"For a Mac with no monitor: a sharper picture over Screen Sharing and VNC." = "適用於沒有螢幕的 Mac：透過螢幕共享與 VNC 獲得更清晰的畫面。";
"Many external drives and NAS volumes park or disconnect after a few minutes idle, and the next thing that touches them stalls while they spin back up. Keepresso rewrites a tiny hidden marker file in the folder you choose, just enough activity to keep the volume awake. Pick an interval shorter than the drive's own idle timeout. This runs whenever Keepresso is running, with or without a keep-awake session, so a drive stays ready even when the Mac is free to sleep." = "許多外接硬碟和 NAS 磁碟區會在閒置數分鐘後停轉或中斷連線，接下來任何存取它們的操作都會卡住，直到它們重新轉動。Keepresso 會在您選擇的資料夾中重寫一個微小的隱藏標記檔案，僅產生足以讓磁碟區保持喚醒的活動量。請選擇比硬碟自身閒置逾時更短的間隔。只要 Keepresso 正在執行，無論是否有保持喚醒工作階段都會執行此操作，因此即使 Mac 可自由進入睡眠，硬碟仍會保持就緒狀態。";
"Stops an external drive or NAS from spinning down." = "避免外接硬碟或 NAS 停止轉動。";
"General" = "一般";
