"Keeps the Mac awake while a coding-agent session (claude, codex, gemini, aider, and the like) is actively working, judged by its CPU use, and lets it sleep once every session has gone idle for the grace period. The menu lists each detected session. A freshly started session can take a few seconds to read as working." = "在編碼代理工作階段（claude、codex、gemini、aider 等）依其 CPU 使用情況判斷為正在實際工作時保持 Mac 喚醒，並在所有工作階段閒置滿寬限期後允許 Mac 睡眠。選單會列出偵測到的每個工作階段。剛啟動的工作階段可能需要幾秒鐘才會顯示為工作中。";
