"Stops the Mac from sleeping at all, even with no session running. This flips a system setting that needs administrator rights: silent with the administrator helper installed (Preferences ▸ General), otherwise macOS asks for your password." = "即使沒有工作階段正在執行，也會讓 Mac 完全不會進入睡眠。這會切換一項需要系統管理員權限的系統設定：已安裝系統管理員輔助程式時會靜默執行（偏好設定 ▸ 一般），否則 macOS 會要求輸入密碼。";
"Stops the Mac from sleeping at all, even with no session running. It works by flipping a system setting (pmset disablesleep), so it stays in effect until you turn it off, even if Keepresso quits. The display still sleeps as usual. “Only while brewing” ties it to the session instead, on when a keep-awake session starts, off when it ends or Keepresso quits (even after a crash). Both need administrator rights: silent with the administrator helper installed (see the top of this tab), otherwise macOS asks for your password, once per app run for “Only while brewing”." = "即使沒有工作階段正在執行，也會讓 Mac 完全不會進入睡眠。其運作方式是切換一項系統設定（pmset disablesleep），因此在您將其關閉前都會持續生效，即使 Keepresso 結束也一樣。螢幕仍會照常進入睡眠。「僅在保持喚醒工作階段期間」則改為將其與工作階段綁定：於保持喚醒工作階段開始時開啟，於工作階段結束或 Keepresso 結束時關閉（即使是當機之後）。兩者皆需要系統管理員權限：已安裝系統管理員輔助程式時會靜默執行（請參閱此分頁頂端），否則 macOS 會要求輸入密碼，「僅在保持喚醒工作階段期間」為每次執行 App 時要求一次。";
"%@ before" = "提前 %@";
"(max %@)" = "（最高 %@）";
"15 seconds" = "15 秒";
"A safety net for a Mac left running with the lid closed, slid into a bag with a session still holding it awake. It acts only in that trapped state: lid shut, with “Keep awake with the lid closed” overriding sleep. Watch macOS's own thermal pressure (works everywhere, “Serious” is where throttling bites) or specific temperature sensors, and if the reading stays over the threshold for the chosen time, Keepresso escalates: first, optionally, it boosts the fans (never below what the system chose, needs the administrator helper), and if it stays hot for the same time again, it pauses the session and switches the sleep override off, so the Mac can finally sleep and cool, telling you why in a notification. Opening the lid, or readings recovering, undoes everything: fan control returns to the system, the override comes back, and the session resumes. Die sensors on modern Macs routinely run at 90-100 °C under load, so thresholds around 95-100 °C are sensible." = "溫度安全網，用於 Mac 闔蓋運作、被塞進背包，但工作階段仍讓它保持喚醒的情況。此機制僅在該受困狀態下作動：闔蓋，且「闔蓋時保持喚醒」正覆寫睡眠設定。它會監看 macOS 本身的溫度壓力（適用於所有機型，「嚴重」是開始降頻節流之處）或特定溫度感測器，若讀數在所選時間內持續超過閾值，Keepresso 便會逐步升級因應：首先（可選）為風扇加速（絕不低於系統原本選擇的轉速，需要系統管理員輔助程式），若溫度在相同時間內仍居高不下，便會暫停工作階段並關閉睡眠停用開關，讓 Mac 終於可以進入睡眠並降溫，並透過通知說明原因。開啟上蓋，或讀數恢復正常，會將一切還原：風扇控制權交還系統，停用開關恢復原狀，工作階段也會繼續。現代 Mac 的晶片溫度感測器在高負載下經常運作於 90–100 °C，因此閾值設在 95–100 °C 左右是合理的選擇。";
"A small system service for the switches that need administrator rights: closed-display mode below, the thermal fan boost, and AWDL pausing in Gaming & Streaming. Without it, macOS asks for your password once per app run (and fan boost stays off entirely: fan control can't prompt). With it, everything is instant and silent: macOS asks once, when you approve the helper under Login Items, and the approval survives restarts and app updates. Updates never need a reinstall, the service replaces itself with the app. It can only flip those specific switches, everything it changes is restored if Keepresso quits or crashes, and you can remove it here at any time. It also puts the keepresso command-line tool on your PATH (Homebrew installs already have it). After removal, System Settings can keep showing a stale Login Items row until macOS refreshes its list. The status shown here is the real one." = "一個小型系統服務，用於需要系統管理員權限的開關：下方的闔蓋模式、溫度風扇加速，以及「遊戲與串流」中的 AWDL 暫停功能。若未安裝，macOS 會在每次執行 App 時要求輸入一次密碼（且風扇加速會完全停用：風扇控制無法跳出密碼要求）。安裝後，一切都會即時且靜默執行：macOS 只會在您於「登入項目」中核准此輔助程式時詢問一次，且此核准會在重新開機與 App 更新後依然有效。更新永遠不需要重新安裝，此服務會以新版本自行取代自己。它只能切換那些特定的開關，其所變更的一切都會在 Keepresso 結束或當機時還原，您也可以隨時在此處移除它。它還會將 keepresso 命令列工具加入您的 PATH（Homebrew 安裝已內建此工具）。移除後，系統設定可能仍會顯示過時的「登入項目」列，直到 macOS 重新整理清單為止。此處顯示的狀態才是真實狀態。";
