"How see-through the menu-bar dropdown is. Frosty (0%) backs its glass with blur and a wash of the window color, so text stays crisp on any wallpaper. Sliding toward 100% thins that backing away until the panel is the system's bare Liquid Glass, letting the desktop shine through, with some contrast cost on busy or very dark wallpapers. Changes apply instantly, only to the dropdown (windows like this one keep their standard look), and the system's Reduce Transparency accessibility setting always wins." = "選單列下拉選單的穿透程度。霧面（0%）會在玻璃背後加上模糊效果與一層視窗色調，讓文字在任何桌布下都維持清晰。滑向 100% 會逐漸削弱這層背襯，直到面板呈現系統原生的純粹 Liquid Glass 效果，讓桌面透出，但在繁忙或非常深色的桌布上會犧牲部分對比度。變更會立即套用，且僅影響此下拉選單（像這個視窗一樣的其他視窗仍維持標準外觀），系統的「降低透明度」輔助使用設定則永遠優先。";
"Install a small helper service so closed-display mode, the thermal fan boost, and AWDL pausing work without password prompts. macOS will ask you to allow it in System Settings, once. Nothing else changes." = "安裝一個小型輔助服務，讓闔蓋模式、溫度風扇加速與 AWDL 暫停功能都能在無需輸入密碼的情況下運作。macOS 會要求您在系統設定中核准一次，其他項目則不會有任何變動。";
