"Switching off closed-display mode during a heat pause needs the administrator helper. Watching temperatures and pausing work without it. Installing asks for your approval once, in System Settings." = "在因高溫暫停時關閉闔蓋模式，需要系統管理員輔助程式。監看溫度與暫停功能則不需要它即可運作。安裝時只需在系統設定中核准一次。";
