"Temperature sensors" = "溫度感測器";
"Temperature threshold" = "溫度閾值";
"Temperatures recovered" = "溫度已恢復正常";
"Test Fans" = "測試風扇";
"Test stopped. Fan control is back with the system." = "測試已停止，控制權已交還系統。";
"The Mac has cooled down. Keepresso is back to normal control." = "Mac 已降溫，Keepresso 已恢復正常控制。";
"The administrator helper didn't accept fan control. Check its status in the section above, then run the test again." = "系統管理員輔助程式未接受風扇控制要求。請查看上方區段的狀態，再重新執行測試。";
"The administrator helper didn't accept the fan boost. The rest of the thermal safety net still applies." = "系統管理員輔助程式未接受風扇加速要求。溫度安全網的其餘部分仍會照常運作。";
"The administrator helper is still updating itself to this version of Keepresso. Fan boost engages once that finishes, and the rest of the thermal safety net still applies." = "系統管理員輔助程式仍在自我更新至此版本的 Keepresso。更新完成後風扇加速即可啟用，溫度安全網的其餘部分仍會照常運作。";
"The fan test needs the administrator helper." = "風扇測試需要系統管理員輔助程式。";
"The fans are boosted for heat right now, so the test stays off until readings recover." = "風扇目前正因高溫而加速中，因此測試將暫停，直到讀數恢復正常。";
"The fans didn't follow the boost, so this Mac's firmware likely refuses manual fan control. The rest of the thermal safety net still works, the boost stage will just be skipped." = "風扇未依指示加速，這台 Mac 的韌體很可能拒絕手動風扇控制。溫度安全網的其餘部分仍會照常運作，僅會略過加速階段。";
"The firmware kept refusing manual fan control, so the fans are back with the system. The rest of the thermal safety net still applies." = "韌體持續拒絕手動風扇控制，因此風扇控制權已交還系統。溫度安全網的其餘部分仍會照常運作。";
"The helper is updating itself to this version of Keepresso (no password needed). Fan boost and this test unlock when it finishes, usually under a minute." = "輔助程式正在自我更新至此版本的 Keepresso（不需要密碼）。更新完成後（通常不到一分鐘），風扇加速與此測試即會解鎖。";
"The helper service is updating itself to this version of Keepresso in the background. No reinstall or password is needed. Features new to this version wait until it finishes, usually under a minute." = "輔助服務正在背景自我更新至此版本的 Keepresso，不需要重新安裝或輸入密碼。此版本新增的功能會等待更新完成後才能使用，通常不到一分鐘。";
"Window transparency" = "視窗透明度";
"Thermal" = "溫度";
"Appearance" = "外觀";
"If the Mac runs hot with the lid closed, the session pauses so it can sleep and cool down." = "若 Mac 在闔蓋時過熱，工作階段會暫停，讓 Mac 得以進入睡眠並降溫。";
"The menu-bar dropdown's glass, from frosty to clear Liquid Glass." = "選單列下拉選單的玻璃效果，從霧面到清透的 Liquid Glass。";
