"%dm" = "%d分";
"/bin/sh -c …" = "/bin/sh -c …";
"A wake schedule is saved, but it is not active on this Mac until the administrator helper is ready. The system will not wake from this plan." = "已儲存喚醒排程，但要等管理員輔助程式就緒才會生效。系統不會依此計劃喚醒。";
"Add Hook" = "新增鉤子";
"Add Hook…" = "新增鉤子…";
