"Edit hook" = "編輯鉤子";
"Event hooks" = "事件鉤子";
"Fires a few seconds after a natural end, not on a manual stop or a safety pause." = "在自然結束後數秒執行，手動停止或安全暫停時不會。";
"How long Keepresso held the Mac awake each day, from the decision log. Battery drop is shown when both ends of a session had a reading." = "依決策日誌，Keepresso 每天讓 Mac 保持喚醒多久。僅當工作階段兩端都有讀數時才顯示耗電。";
"Indefinite" = "無限期";
"Installing a wake schedule needs the administrator helper (Preferences ▸ General)." = "設定喚醒排程需要管理員輔助程式（偏好設定 ▸ 一般）。";
"Locks via System Events. macOS may ask once for Automation access for Keepresso." = "透過 System Events 鎖定。macOS 可能向 Keepresso 要求一次「自動化」權限。";
"No event hooks yet." = "尚無事件鉤子。";
"No held-awake time in the last week." = "過去一週沒有保持喚醒時間。";
"Notifications fire when a session ends on its own, not when you stop it yourself." = "工作階段自行結束時會通知，你自己停止時不會。";
"Off" = "關";
"One step left: allow Keepresso under Login Items in System Settings. Scheduled wake unlocks by itself." = "還差一步：在系統設定的登入項目中允許 Keepresso。排程喚醒會自行解鎖。";
"One-shot wake" = "單次喚醒";
"One-shot: %@" = "單次：%@";
"Reliable on AC power. On battery the firmware may skip the wake." = "接電源時可靠。使用電池時韌體可能略過喚醒。";
"Repeat daily / weekly" = "每日／每週重複";
"Repeating: every day at %@" = "重複：每天 %@";
"Run a Shortcut, post a webhook, or a shell command on session and trigger events. No helper required." = "在工作階段與觸發事件上執行捷徑、Webhook 或 shell 指令。不需要輔助程式。";
"Scheduled wake" = "排程喚醒";
"Scheduled wake needs the administrator helper, the same one closed-display mode and fan boost use. Install once, and macOS asks for approval in System Settings." = "排程喚醒需要管理員輔助程式，與合蓋模式和風扇加速相同。安裝一次即可；macOS 會在系統設定中要求核准。";
"Session length" = "工作階段長度";
"Shell" = "Shell";
"Shortcut" = "捷徑";
"Shortcut name" = "捷徑名稱";
"Sleeps the Mac through the administrator helper (instant, no extra prompts)." = "透過管理員輔助程式讓 Mac 睡眠（即時，無額外提示）。";
"Start keep-awake on wake" = "喚醒後保持不休眠";
"Starts keep-awake on wake" = "喚醒時啟動保持喚醒";
"System one-shot wakes: %@" = "系統單次喚醒：%@";
"System repeating: %@" = "系統重複：%@";
"The administrator helper could not update the system wake schedule." = "管理員輔助程式無法更新系統喚醒排程。";
"The helper is updating itself (no password). Scheduled wake unlocks when that finishes, usually under a minute." = "輔助程式正在自行更新（無需密碼）。完成後排程喚醒會解鎖，通常不到一分鐘。";
"The helper is updating itself. Until that finishes, sleep falls back to System Events, which may ask for Automation access once." = "輔助程式正在自行更新。完成前，睡眠退回 System Events，可能要求一次自動化權限。";
"The helper is waiting for approval in System Settings. Until then, sleep falls back to System Events, which may ask for Automation access once." = "輔助程式正在系統設定中等待核准。在此之前，睡眠退回 System Events，可能要求一次自動化權限。";
"These cover the times a session ends without you: a timer expiring, or trigger conditions dropping. Stopping it yourself stays silent, since you already know. The warning is a heads-up a few minutes before a timed session runs out, so you can extend it before the Mac drops off. Actions that put the Mac to sleep live under Automation." = "涵蓋你不在場時工作階段結束的情況：計時到期或觸發條件消失。自己停止則保持安靜。警告在定時結束前幾分鐘發出，便於延長。讓 Mac 睡眠的操作在「自動化」中。";
"Time" = "時間";
"Total" = "合計";
"Turn Off Wake Schedule" = "關閉喚醒排程";
"Turn on a one-shot time, a repeating time, or both. With neither, nothing is installed on the system." = "開啟單次時間、重複時間，或兩者都開。都不開則不會在系統上安裝任何內容。";
"Uses every day (MTWRFSU). macOS allows only one system-wide repeating power schedule." = "每天（MTWRFSU）。macOS 全系統只允許一套重複電源排程。";
"Wake at" = "喚醒時間";
"Wake schedule" = "喚醒排程";
"Wake schedule not installed" = "未安裝喚醒排程";
"Wake the Mac at a set time through the administrator helper (pmset schedule / repeat), then optionally start a keep-awake session so it does not fall back asleep before the job runs. Pair with an end-of-session action above for wake, work, sleep. Scheduled wake is reliable on AC power. On battery the firmware may skip it. macOS only allows one system-wide repeating power schedule, so enabling ours replaces whatever was there. The controls stay locked until the helper is installed and ready, the same rule as the thermal fan boost." = "透過管理員輔助程式在設定時間喚醒 Mac（pmset schedule / repeat），並可選擇啟動保持喚醒，以免工作開始前再次入睡。可與上方工作階段結束動作搭配：喚醒、工作、睡眠。接電源時可靠；使用電池時韌體可能略過。macOS 全系統只允許一套重複電源排程，啟用我們的會取代既有排程。控制項在輔助程式就緒前保持鎖定，與熱風扇加速相同。";
"Webhook" = "Webhook";
"When a keep-awake session ends on its own (a timer expiring, or trigger conditions dropping), Keepresso can put the display to sleep, lock the screen, start the screen saver, or sleep the Mac. Off by default so a timed session never surprises you. Manual stops, and the battery and thermal safety pauses, never run this action. A brief debounce cancels it if the session restarts right away." = "當保持喚醒工作階段自行結束（計時到期或觸發條件消失）時，Keepresso 可使顯示器睡眠、鎖定螢幕、啟動螢幕保護程式或讓 Mac 睡眠。預設關閉，以免定時工作階段嚇人。手動停止以及電池／熱安全暫停從不執行此動作。若工作階段立刻重啟，短暫防抖會取消它。";
"When something happens in Keepresso, run a Shortcut, POST a webhook, or run a shell command. Useful for a push to your phone when an overnight agent finishes (ntfy, or a Shortcut that sends a notification). Hooks are suspended while you edit them, so a half-written command never runs. No administrator helper needed. User-authored shell commands are intentional in this unsandboxed app: only add commands you trust." = "Keepresso 中發生事件時，執行捷徑、POST Webhook 或 shell 指令。適合通宵代理結束後推送到手機（ntfy 或發通知的捷徑）。編輯時鉤子暫停。不需要管理員輔助程式。在此未沙盒應用中允許使用者 shell 指令：只新增你信任的指令。";
"When the Mac wakes near this schedule, Keepresso starts a session so it does not fall back asleep. Works best with triggers off for that window, or with a trigger that stays satisfied." = "若 Mac 在此排程附近喚醒，Keepresso 會啟動工作階段以免立刻再睡。該時段最好關閉觸發條件，或使用會持續滿足的條件。";
"Why each session started or stopped, newest first. Saved on disk and restored after a relaunch." = "每次工作階段為何開始或停止，最新在前。已存磁碟，重新啟動後還原。";
"Without the administrator helper, sleep uses System Events and may ask for Automation access once. Install the helper under Preferences ▸ General for instant, silent sleep." = "沒有管理員輔助程式時，睡眠走 System Events，可能要求一次自動化權限。在偏好設定 ▸ 一般安裝輔助程式可即時、靜默睡眠。";
"https://…" = "https://…";
"−%d%% battery" = "−%d%% 電量";
"Held awake by an automation lease" = "由一個自動化租約保持喚醒";
"Held awake by %d automation leases" = "由 %d 個自動化租約保持喚醒";
"and %d more" = "還有 %d 個";
"Allow automation leases" = "允許自動化租約";
"Allow automation to change the wake schedule" = "允許自動化變更喚醒排程";
"Automation access" = "自動化存取權";
"A lease is a bounded keep-awake grant an outside tool asks for through the keepresso command line or the bundled MCP server: an AI agent working overnight, a render script, a backup job. Each lease has a time limit its owner must keep renewing, plus a hard seven day ceiling, so a crashed tool can never hold the Mac awake for good. The menu shows every live lease, Stop ends them all, and the Mac can sleep again after the last one finishes. Turning leases off ends any live lease. The wake schedule switch is separate and off by default because a scheduled wake is a system-wide change applied by the administrator helper: leave it off unless a tool you trust should plan wake-ups for you." = "租約是外部工具透過 keepresso 命令列或內建 MCP 伺服器要求的一段限時保持喚醒授權：例如通宵工作的 AI 代理、轉譯指令碼，或備份工作。每份租約都有時間上限，且持有者必須持續續約，另外還有七天的硬性上限，因此當機的工具絕不會讓 Mac 永久保持喚醒。選單會顯示每份有效租約，按下「停止」可全部結束，最後一份結束後 Mac 便可再次進入睡眠。關閉租約功能會結束所有有效租約。喚醒排程開關是獨立的功能，預設為關閉，因為排程喚醒是由系統管理員輔助程式套用的系統層級變更：除非您信任某個工具可代您安排喚醒時間，否則請保持關閉。";
"Copy Agent Instructions" = "複製代理指示";
"Copy MCP Setup" = "複製 MCP 設定";
"For Claude Code (JSON)" = "適用於 Claude Code（JSON）";
"For Gemini CLI (JSON)" = "適用於 Gemini CLI（JSON）";
"For Grok (JSON)" = "適用於 Grok（JSON）";
"For Codex (TOML)" = "適用於 Codex（TOML）";
"Server path only" = "僅伺服器路徑";
"Reveal Skill Folder" = "顯示技能資料夾";
"Copied. Paste it to your agent in a new chat to teach it to manage Keepresso." = "已複製。請在新的對話中將其貼給您的代理，教它管理 Keepresso。";
"Copied. Paste it into your agent's MCP configuration file." = "已複製。請貼到您代理的 MCP 設定檔案中。";
"Copied. Use it as the MCP server command in your agent's settings." = "已複製。請在您代理的設定中，將其用作 MCP 伺服器指令。";
"After the last session ends" = "最後一個工作階段結束後";
"When the last thing keeping the Mac awake ends on its own (a timer expiring, trigger conditions dropping, or the final automation lease releasing), Keepresso can put the display to sleep, lock the screen, start the screen saver, or sleep the Mac. Leases count: while any lease is live the session continues and nothing fires. Off by default so a timed session never surprises you. Manual stops, and the battery and thermal safety pauses, never run this action. A brief debounce cancels it if the session restarts right away." = "當保持 Mac 喚醒的最後一件事自行結束時（計時器到期、觸發條件不再成立，或最後一個自動化租約釋放），Keepresso 可以讓螢幕進入睡眠、鎖定螢幕、啟動螢幕保護程式，或讓 Mac 進入睡眠。租約也算數：只要有任何租約仍然有效，工作階段就會繼續，不會觸發任何動作。預設為關閉，因此定時工作階段不會讓您措手不及。手動停止，以及電池與溫度安全暫停，都不會執行此動作。若工作階段立即重新開始，短暫的防彈跳機制會取消此動作。";
"While you play" = "遊玩時";
"Give the game high CPU priority" = "提高遊戲的 CPU 優先權";
"Raises the active game or streaming app's CPU priority through the administrator helper, so background work (builds, backups, agent sessions) cannot steal frames. Normal priority comes back after you stop playing, and always when the game quits." = "透過系統管理員輔助程式，提高作用中遊戲或串流 App 的 CPU 優先權，讓背景工作（建置、備份、代理工作階段）無法搶走影格。停止遊玩後會恢復正常優先權，遊戲結束時也一定會恢復。";
"Needs the administrator helper (Preferences ▸ General): raising a process's priority is a root-only change." = "需要系統管理員輔助程式（偏好設定 ▸ 一般）：提高處理程序的優先權是僅限 root 執行的變更。";
"Boosting the current game." = "正在提升目前遊戲的優先權。";
"Keep the display awake with a controller" = "用控制器讓螢幕保持喚醒";
"Controller input does not always count as user activity, so a gamepad-only session can dim or sleep the display mid-game. While a game is in front, a controller is connected, and a keep-awake session is active, Keepresso reports activity for you every half minute." = "控制器輸入不一定會被視為使用者活動，因此僅靠控制器操作的工作階段，螢幕仍可能在遊戲進行中變暗或進入睡眠。當遊戲位於最前、已連接控制器，且保持喚醒工作階段正在進行時，Keepresso 會每半分鐘替您回報一次活動。";
"Game controller connected" = "已連接遊戲控制器";
"Counts while any game controller is connected, wired or Bluetooth. Rides out a brief reconnect for half a minute." = "只要已連接任何遊戲控制器（有線或藍牙）即會計入，並可撐過半分鐘內的短暫斷線重連。";
"One step left: allow Keepresso under Login Items in System Settings. The priority boost unlocks by itself." = "還差一步：在系統設定的登入項目中允許 Keepresso。優先權提升會自行解鎖。";
"The helper is updating itself (no password). The priority boost unlocks when that finishes, usually under a minute." = "輔助程式正在自行更新（無需密碼）。完成後優先權提升會解鎖，通常不到一分鐘。";
"Raising a game's priority is a root-only change, so it needs the administrator helper, the same one closed-display mode and fan boost use. Install once, and macOS asks for approval in System Settings." = "提高遊戲的優先權是僅限 root 執行的變更，因此需要系統管理員輔助程式，與闔蓋模式和風扇加速使用的是同一個。安裝一次即可，macOS 會在系統設定中要求核准。";
"Locked until the helper is ready" = "輔助程式就緒前鎖定";
"macOS scans for AirDrop, Handoff, and Sidecar peers on the same Wi-Fi radio about once a second, and each hop can spike your ping. That reads as stutter in cloud gaming, remote play, and live streams. The watchdog turns those hops off (pausing the AWDL interface) while you play and brings everything back afterward, automatically with the game detection below or manually with the switch." = "macOS 大約每秒會在同一個 Wi-Fi 無線電上掃描 AirDrop、Handoff 與 Sidecar 的對等裝置，每次跳頻都可能讓您的 ping 值飆升。這在雲端遊戲、遠端遊玩與直播串流中會表現為頓卡。看門狗會在您遊玩時關閉這些跳頻（暫停 AWDL 介面），事後再將一切恢復：可透過下方的遊戲偵測自動執行，也可用開關手動控制。";
"The stutter fix for streaming and online gaming." = "串流與連線遊戲的頓卡解決方案。";
"Steam is downloading" = "Steam 正在下載";
"Counts while Steam is actively downloading or updating a game in any of its libraries, and lets the Mac sleep once the download finishes or is paused. Reads Steam's own bookkeeping, no permission needed." = "只要 Steam 在任一個遊戲庫中持續下載或更新遊戲，就會計入；下載完成或暫停後即可讓 Mac 進入睡眠。讀取的是 Steam 自身的記錄，不需要任何權限。";
